        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 Station Road, Kingscourt, Co. Cavan\r\n\r\nFreshly renovated throughout and right in the centre of Kingscourt.\r\n\r\nKeenan Auctioneers present 4 Station Road, a one-bedroom property finished to a high standard following a complete renovation.\r\n\r\nFresh flooring and painting, new appliances, doors and windows give the property a clean, modern finish throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is arranged over two floors, with the kitchen and living area downstairs and the bedroom and bathroom upstairs. This gives a good separation between the main living and sleeping areas.\r\n\r\nSet on Station Road, Kingscourt Main Street, SuperValu, shops, cafés and everyday amenities are all within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\n**Key Details**\r\n\r\n* One bedroom\r\n* One bathroom\r\n* Freshly renovated throughout\r\n* New flooring, appliances, doors and windows\r\n* Accommodation arranged over two floors\r\n* Central Kingscourt location\r\n\r\nTo apply or request full details, please email [info@keenanauctioneers.com](mailto:info@keenanauctioneers.com) with landlord and s, photo ID, contact number, and details of intended occupants."
      }
